## Tier 4.09 — heap on wasm. `array_sum` builds a heap-allocated Array
## (ruxen_vec_new + push over the bundled wasm allocator) and sums it. Unlike
## examples/05-wasm (pure math, no heap), this exercises String/Array support
## on wasm32-unknown-unknown — the foundation for running the GUI stack in the
## browser. A reactor module exports `array_sum`; no `main` (the host calls it).
def array_sum -> Int
  let v = [10, 20, 12]
  v.sum
end
